msgctxt "SettingsTooltips::travel_core::geocoding_enabled"
msgid "Fill hotel locations from stored coordinates via OSM Nominatim: street addresses, plus the city/region fallback used when a provider's destination tree cannot name them. One switch for every travel addon — the Nominatim policy limits requests per application, not per addon. Results are approximate (nearest mapped address). Displaying OSM data requires a \"© OpenStreetMap contributors\" attribution on the site."
msgstr "Fill hotel locations from stored coordinates via OSM Nominatim: street addresses, plus the city/region fallback used when a provider's destination tree cannot name them. One switch for every travel addon — the Nominatim policy limits requests per application, not per addon. Results are approximate (nearest mapped address). Displaying OSM data requires a \"© OpenStreetMap contributors\" attribution on the site."

